{"question_id": "S002", "question": "SUMMIT 2196 系列泵的入口管路应如何选择和布置？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵的入口管路布置应满足以下要求：\n\n- 所有管路必须单独支撑，并与泵的入口法兰和出口法兰准确对正。\n- 切勿用力将管路与泵法兰对正。\n- 最好在与泵法兰直接相连的接头处放置一小段软短管或波纹式短管。\n\n手册中未提及入口管路的管径、长度、材质等具体选择要求，仅提供了上述布置要求。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2187.0, "input_tokens": 957, "output_tokens": 112, "total_tokens": 1069, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
