{"question_id": "S014", "question": "用塞尺法设置 2196-R 型泵叶轮间隙时，最终塞尺厚度如何确定？", "primary_category": "操作步骤", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 19, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-001-eaf26ba98522"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 20, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-902ad3be0171-000-902ad3be0171"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 5, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-27aa8c4f9db8-000-27aa8c4f9db8"}], "answer": "使用塞尺法设置 2196-R 型泵叶轮间隙时，最终塞尺厚度的确定方法如下：\n\n首先使用塞尺测量轴承架 (228) 与轴承座 (134) 之间的间隙，然后将测得的间隙值减去 0.060”，由此得到轴承架 (228) 与轴承座 (134) 之间的最终塞尺厚度。\n\n依据来源：安装、操作及维护手册 - 2196R 型泵塞尺法，步骤 6。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2672.0, "input_tokens": 2022, "output_tokens": 121, "total_tokens": 2143, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
