{"question_id": "S016", "question": "SUMMIT 手册中，轴承高温运行通常由什么原因造成，如何处理？", "primary_category": "故障诊断", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 14, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}], "answer": "根据SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796型安装、操作及维护手册第18页，轴承高温运转通常由以下原因造成，并可采取相应处理措施：\n\n- 原因：没有对正。  \n  处理：重新对正驱动联轴器。\n\n- 原因：润滑油位低或润滑油不足。  \n  处理：检查油位和/或润滑脂。\n\n- 原因：液体比规定的重量重。  \n  处理：检查液体的比重。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2203.0, "input_tokens": 1092, "output_tokens": 133, "total_tokens": 1225, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "S017", "question": "按 SUMMIT 手册，在尝试维修离心泵之前必须完成哪些安全步骤？", "primary_category": "安全警告", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 7, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d"}], "answer": "根据 SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796 型安装、操作及维护手册第17页，在尝试对泵进行维修之前必须完成以下安全步骤：\n\n1. 执行停机程序。  \n2. 切断电源。  \n3. 使泵冷却。  \n4. 关闭入口阀和出口阀。  \n5. 排空泵。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1750.0, "input_tokens": 1011, "output_tokens": 99, "total_tokens": 1110, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "S018", "question": "SUMMIT 手册规定泵体和叶轮出现多深的凹槽、点蚀或磨损时应更换？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 19, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-000-6b0a2891be0c"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}], "answer": "根据SUMMIT PUMP安装、操作及维护手册：\n\n- 如果泵体的凹槽和点蚀超过 **1/8英寸（约3.18毫米）深**，则应更换泵体。\n- 如果叶轮的凹槽超过 **1/16英寸（约1.59毫米）** 或者磨损超过 **1/32英寸（约0.79毫米）**，则应更换叶轮。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2188.0, "input_tokens": 2041, "output_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 2135, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "S019", "question": "SUMMIT LTO 泵架的外轴承是什么布置方式，安装时还有哪些润滑相关要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 28, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e112e31e2351-000-e112e31e2351"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 29, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-99d80f6fd8a0-000-99d80f6fd8a0"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87"}], "answer": "根据提供的手册内容，SUMMIT LTO 泵架的外轴承布置方式及润滑相关要求如下：\n\n1. **轴承布置方式**：  \n   手册中指出，“确保轴承以正确的顺序、背对背安装。” 这表明LTO泵架的外轴承采用**背对背**的布置方式。\n\n2. **润滑相关要求**：  \n   - 如果采用润滑油润滑，应没有密封件或挡油环。  \n   - 在安装过程中，需在轴承座 (134) 内侧涂上一层薄薄的润滑剂（步骤10）。  \n   - 对于LTO型号，在安装轴承盖时，还需注意安装轴承盖 (109C) 和螺栓 (370G)（步骤11）。\n\n以上信息来自《安装、操作及维护手册 SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796 型》第22页。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 4579.0, "input_tokens": 1489, "output_tokens": 215, "total_tokens": 1704, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
