{"question_id": "D001", "question": "DESMI DNS 系列泵适用于哪些行业，其基本结构是什么？", "primary_category": "普通事实", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 5, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-体说明-56bb9fd3b838-000-56bb9fd3b838"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 4, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-c493e2a39742-000-c493e2a39742"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 5, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-体说明-656758c8defd-000-656758c8defd"}], "answer": "DESMI DNS 系列泵适用于水处理、工艺流程、制药行业、石油化工、食品工业、造纸工业、冶金工业、一般工业和污水处理等行业。\n\n其基本结构为一台卧式离心泵，配备不锈钢泵轴、机械轴封和闭式叶轮。泵轴通过柔性联轴器与电机轴联接，吸入口和排出口采用铸造法兰，符合欧盟法兰标准。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1672.0, "input_tokens": 1445, "output_tokens": 87, "total_tokens": 1532, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
