{"question_id": "D003", "question": "DESMI 手册中的“危险”“警告”“小心”分别代表什么风险等级和后果？", "primary_category": "安全警告", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 7, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-1cfb2c984ef7-000-1cfb2c984ef7"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 3, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-ad404fcfe9d1-000-ad404fcfe9d1"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 33, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570"}], "answer": "根据DESMI手册内容：\n\n- **危险**：表示具有高风险的危险，不避免会导致死亡或重伤事故。\n- **警告**：表示中等风险的危险，不避免可能导致死亡或重伤事故。\n- **小心**：表示低风险的危险，不避免可能导致产品或系统损坏事故。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1563.0, "input_tokens": 1590, "output_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 1657, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D004", "question": "DESMI DNS 泵的预期用途对干运行、最小流量、最大流量和吸入侧节流有什么限制？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 18, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-7318227c6dad-000-7318227c6dad"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS 泵的预期用途对相关运行条件的限制如下：\n\n- **干运行**：决不允许在没有待处理液体的状态下运行水泵。\n\n- **最小流量**：必须遵守产品资料中规定的最小流量要求，以防止过热、轴承损坏等。\n\n- **最大流量**：必须遵守产品资料中规定的最大流量要求，以防止过热、机械密封损坏、气蚀损坏、轴承损坏等。\n\n- **吸入侧节流**：不允许限制水泵吸入侧的流量，以防止气蚀损坏。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2204.0, "input_tokens": 1483, "output_tokens": 119, "total_tokens": 1602, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
