{"question_id": "D006", "question": "DESMI DNS 泵在霜冻期停用时应如何防冻？", "primary_category": "操作步骤", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-2d7994f5896c-000-2d7994f5896c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 4, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-c493e2a39742-000-c493e2a39742"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS 泵在霜冻期停用时应采取以下防冻措施：\n\n在霜冻期不运行的水泵必须进行排水，以避免霜冻造成损坏。具体操作为拆卸底部管塞（3），排空水泵。或者也可以在正常水泵配置中使用防冻液。\n\n来源：手册第10页，2.8 防冻部分。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1781.0, "input_tokens": 1605, "output_tokens": 87, "total_tokens": 1692, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D007", "question": "运输 DESMI 泵组时，吊运装置禁止固定在哪里，还应注意哪些事项？", "primary_category": "安全警告", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 13, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-时存放-d566b9b2e7f0-000-d566b9b2e7f0"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 48, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-卸泵组-d94509f9b71d-000-d94509f9b71d"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-2d7994f5896c-000-2d7994f5896c"}], "answer": "运输 DESMI 泵组时，吊运装置禁止固定在泵轴自由端或电机吊环上。\n\n还应注意以下事项：\n- 始终在规定位置运输水泵（泵组）。\n- 监测重量数据和中心位置。\n- 采用适当、经允许的吊运配件，比如自紧式吊夹。\n- 吊带不允许抵住锋利边缘和角落。\n- 装运前，将水泵牢固地固定在托盘等结构上。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2109.0, "input_tokens": 1420, "output_tokens": 105, "total_tokens": 1525, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D008", "question": "DESMI 泵组存放环境和泵轴手动转动频率有什么要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-8feed9ec71ae-000-8feed9ec71ae"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 37, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-07d5c9ba07e1-000-07d5c9ba07e1"}], "answer": "根据提供的手册内容，关于DESMI泵组的存放环境和泵轴手动转动频率的要求如下：\n\n1. **存放环境要求**：\n   - 手册中未明确提及具体的存放环境（如温度、湿度等）要求。但提到“环境温度低于0度时，避免水泵冻结”，暗示应避免在冰冻条件下存放，防止水泵损坏。\n\n2. **泵轴手动转动频率要求**：\n   - 如果水泵停机或停用较长时间，为防止沉积物形成，建议**每月一次到每三个月一次**之间定期启动水泵（泵组）运行约五分钟。\n   - 若将水泵从管道上拆下并保存，未明确说明手动盘车频率，但建议往泵壳内壁喷涂防腐剂以进行保护。\n\n综上，长期停用期间应定期启动泵组运转几分钟，频率为每月至每季度一次；存放时应避免冻结条件。更详细的存放环境参数手册中未提供。\n\n参考页码：33（调试、启动和关闭章节）。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 4000.0, "input_tokens": 1484, "output_tokens": 218, "total_tokens": 1702, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D009", "question": "DESMI DNS 系列泵的一般介质温度、最大密度和最大粘度范围是多少？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-8feed9ec71ae-000-8feed9ec71ae"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 18, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-7318227c6dad-000-7318227c6dad"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS 系列泵的一般工作规格如下：\n\n- **介质温度范围**：未明确具体数值，但注意事项中提到：\n  - 环境温度低于0°C时，应避免水泵冻结。\n  - 若环境温度大于40°C或电机在海拔1000 m以上运行，电机冷却效果会下降，可能需要调整电机功率。\n\n- **最大密度**：2500 kg/m³  \n- **最大粘度**：500 cSt\n\n（依据来源：技术规格章节下的“介质密度和粘度”部分）", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2750.0, "input_tokens": 1351, "output_tokens": 129, "total_tokens": 1480, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D010", "question": "DESMI 手册给出的最小进水压力由哪些项组成？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 18, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-7318227c6dad-000-7318227c6dad"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c"}], "answer": "根据DESMI手册，最小进水压力由以下项组成：\n\nNPSHreq + 吸入管工作摩擦力 + 液体蒸汽压力 – 液体表面压力 + 0.5 m\n\n（这是在特定水泵运行条件和特定泵送介质条件下不会导致水泵气蚀的压力。NPSHreq参见合同技术文件。）", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1718.0, "input_tokens": 1370, "output_tokens": 79, "total_tokens": 1449, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D011", "question": "DESMI 建议泵前吸入直管段长度为多少？DN100 泵对应多少毫米？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 21, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-cc20e38cbf4c-000-cc20e38cbf4c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 21, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-2f479eae20bf-000-2f479eae20bf"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-23fbf21e5cf5-000-23fbf21e5cf5"}], "answer": "DESMI 建议泵前吸入直管段长度“X”大约是管道直径的3至5倍。对于一台DN100泵，相当于300至500毫米。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1141.0, "input_tokens": 671, "output_tokens": 45, "total_tokens": 716, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D012", "question": "DESMI 手册对吸入侧弯管、T 型管、弯曲半径和管道截面变化有什么要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 22, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-4c0decacc13b-000-4c0decacc13b"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 22, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-c79b53d407c9-000-c79b53d407c9"}], "answer": "根据 DESMI 手册内容，对吸入侧弯管、T 型管、弯曲半径和管道截面变化的要求如下：\n\n- 应避免在水泵吸入侧设置 90 度弯管、T 型管或其他可能阻碍水流的部件。\n- 避免曲率半径小于标称管径的 1.5 倍。\n- 避免管道系统横截面突然变化。\n\n这些要求旨在确保吸入侧水流顺畅，防止气蚀损坏并保证泵的正常运行。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2188.0, "input_tokens": 798, "output_tokens": 114, "total_tokens": 912, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D013", "question": "DESMI DNS 泵管路支撑和进口侧流速有什么要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-23fbf21e5cf5-000-23fbf21e5cf5"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 21, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-2f479eae20bf-000-2f479eae20bf"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS泵的管路支撑和进口侧流速要求如下：\n\n**管路支撑要求：**\n- 管道必须有独立的支撑，不能将任何作用力传递到水泵上，否则可能导致机封和轴承损坏。\n- 管道支撑的设计应涵盖所有可能的工况条件，包括冷态/热态、空管/满管、无压/承压状态下的管道受力情况。\n- 泵脚的各个边缘都应与支撑托架完全接触。\n- 底板/底架上的所有螺栓必须按建议扭矩拧紧，以减少潜在振动。\n\n**进口侧流速要求：**\n- 进口侧管道内流速应满足：v < 3 m/s。\n- 注：对于分流至多台并联水泵的歧管，推荐流速 v < 1.5 m/s。\n- 注：在某些安装中和/或短期运行条件下，允许更高的流速。\n\n以上信息来源于手册第19-22页相关内容。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 3532.0, "input_tokens": 1268, "output_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 1491, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D014", "question": "DESMI 手册对出口流速、杂质监测、阀门关闭运行和 BEP 范围有哪些规定？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 22, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-4c0decacc13b-000-4c0decacc13b"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 33, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570"}], "answer": "手册中未检索到充分依据，无法可靠回答该问题。", "refused": true, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 500.0, "input_tokens": 1274, "output_tokens": 14, "total_tokens": 1288, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D015", "question": "DESMI 手册中最大吸上高度 H 的计算公式是什么，安全裕度 Hs 建议多少？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 25, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-17ce9c469745-000-17ce9c469745"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}], "answer": "最大吸上高度 H 的计算公式为：\n\nH = Hb - NPSHr - Hf - Hv - Hs\n\n其中：\n- Hb = 测压计显示的液体压头 (m) = Pb×10.2/SG (m)\n- NPSHr = 必需汽蚀余量 (m)\n- Hf = 进水口管道损耗 (m)\n- Hv = 实际液体的蒸汽压力 (m)\n- Hs = 安全裕度\n\n手册中未检索到充分依据，无法可靠回答该问题。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2594.0, "input_tokens": 1297, "output_tokens": 123, "total_tokens": 1420, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D016", "question": "DESMI 泵和电机联轴器的对中偏差上限是多少，测量时如何布点？", "primary_category": "操作步骤", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-a9a63e1e9e9c-000-a9a63e1e9e9c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 19, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-ee9e71b6148a-000-ee9e71b6148a"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 26, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-f6f642d9c92b-000-f6f642d9c92b"}], "answer": "DESMI 泵和电机联轴器的对中偏差上限为 ≤0.1 mm。测量时应在圆周方向每隔 90° 测一次。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 921.0, "input_tokens": 975, "output_tokens": 37, "total_tokens": 1012, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D017", "question": "DESMI 联轴器外圆直径为 360–410 mm 时，联轴器间隙 S 应是多少？", "primary_category": "表格查询", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-a9a63e1e9e9c-000-a9a63e1e9e9c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 46, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-修计划-43023e3d4394-000-43023e3d4394"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，当 DESMI 联轴器外圆直径为 360–410 mm 时，联轴器之间的间隙 S 应为 5 mm。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1063.0, "input_tokens": 773, "output_tokens": 41, "total_tokens": 814, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D018", "question": "DESMI 泵组调试或启动前应满足哪些前提条件？", "primary_category": "操作步骤", "strategy": "top_1_parent", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 28, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2a44c976502c-000-2a44c976502c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 4, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-c493e2a39742-000-c493e2a39742"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 31, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-84d31a6bae34-000-84d31a6bae34"}], "answer": "DESMI 泵组调试或启动前应满足以下前提条件：\n\n- 泵组已正确连接到电源，而且配备了所有保护装置。  \n- 水泵已充注待处理液体。水泵已完成排气。  \n- 已检查旋转方向。  \n- 所有必要的辅助接口都已完成连接并处于正常工作状态。  \n- 如果可以重新润滑，则在启动水泵之前，按电机手册对电机轴承进行润滑！所有水泵轴承都已经在代斯米工厂内完全润滑，在达到第8章再润滑表格中的计划运行时数前，不需要重新润滑。  \n- 水泵（泵组）长时间停机后，必须开展水泵（泵组）恢复运行所需的相关工作。  \n\n依据来源：手册第6.1节“调试/启动的前提条件”，第26页。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2922.0, "input_tokens": 1916, "output_tokens": 176, "total_tokens": 2092, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
